{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118335","id":3506193999,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7Q_EZP","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118335","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118335.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118335.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118335","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118335/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118335/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118335/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/b62d68254fcbca529e0965b98419119a0d113cd4","number":118335,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Feature/3.x layout tilemap editor","user":{"login":"7erraplanista","id":268324767,"node_id":"U_kgDOD_5Pnw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/268324767?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/7erraplanista","html_url":"https://github.com/7erraplanista","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/7erraplanista/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/7erraplanista/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/7erraplanista/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/7erraplanista/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/7erraplanista/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/7erraplanista/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/7erraplanista/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/7erraplanista/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/7erraplanista/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Hello everyone!\r\n\r\nI was testing a modification in Godot v3.x that the bottom palette of the TileMap editor needed.\r\n\r\nThe atlas tiles are arranged to fit the palette width, making it harder to find the tiles when you have the tile layout in mind:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"549\" height=\"474\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b8032cec-25a3-4cf6-bfef-552567ef2f8c\" />\r\n\r\nTo address this, I added an option to the editor that allows you to arrange the atlas tiles with the same layout as the actual tile:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"744\" height=\"286\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ef2dbb3d-ebf7-43db-817f-eb55c6de0e99\" />\r\n\r\nThis makes it easier to find the tiles you're looking for and also adds the ability to select them. cluster:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"601\" height=\"614\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/45f187c9-1f13-41b7-b329-f6eb90b6b6a7\" />\r\n\r\nThis is it!\r\n\r\nThank you!\r\n\r\n------\r\n\r\nBuenos días gente!\r\n\r\nEstuve probando una modificación en Godot v3.x que le hacía falta a la paleta inferior del editor de TileMap.\r\nLos tiles del atlas se ordenan ajustándose al ancho de paleta y con eso se hace más dificil buscar dónde están los tiles cuando tienes mentalmente la disposición del tileset:\r\n\r\n[Imagen 1 de arriba]\r\n\r\nPara esto agregé una opción en el editor que permita ordenar los tiles del atlas con la misma disposición que en el tileset:\r\n\r\n[Imagen 2 de arriba]\r\n\r\nDe esta forma es más fácil encontrar los tiles que buscabas y además agrego la posibilidad de seleccionarlos en grupo:\r\n\r\n[Imagen 3 de arriba]\r\n\r\nEsto es todo!\r\n\r\nGracias!","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengi